{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"刚真切尝到不必防备的安宁，他身体先一紧，才发现现实里还过不上那种生活，只在心里拥有它还不够。\",\n      \"key\": \"过不上那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光怀念也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"当初不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却不敢再像从前那样不管不顾，怕争取时太用力，会把刚找回的温柔也弄丢。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚找回的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清不肯再等的理由就能安心，可真要往前，他还是拿不准怎么做。\",\n      \"key\": \"拿不准怎么做\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并删去重复项\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁照出现实缺口、身体先受惊的过程，明确他不满足于只在心里拥有那种生活；删去重复自责，不把B5的生活化联想写成真实记忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念改成他当初不肯再等的具体理由，避免先讲普遍道理再补个人经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\", \"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"留下只靠怀念护不住珍惜之物，重新争取又可能磨损刚找回的温柔；两面的风险分别融入已有条目，删去重复的自我逼迫和对称的两难概括。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他原以为想清行动理由就能安心、实际仍拿不准怎么做的变化。具体的行动理由与代价已由前两条说明，不再重复温柔受损的顾虑，并以跨段箭头接回最初寻找充分理由的困境。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dbb701ca-465b-4ea0-b8d7-450d09820f87", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134306992404Z", "elapsed_seconds": 521.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:51:48.531507+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "007ade6bdbe0e4ad161b88f1af929f57aad6187abe3d3330976f6931530b841e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134306992404Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline